abstract: "Reproducible persistent Hodge responses, reflection-odd kernel geometry, constrained torsional derivatives, molecular velocity fields and rotational holonomy, effective quantum rotor models, exact braid fixtures and closure-dependent experimental protein diagnostics, together with external conformer and same-assay ChEMBL analyses. The DOI identifies release 1.0.0. Software is MIT; third-party data retain the licenses documented in data/LICENSES.md."
